Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:56.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh? Oh, great. Now he knows and I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:56.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊？哦，真厉害 他知道而我却不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:59.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I'm just excited about being an aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:59.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，我只是 快当姑姑而兴奋过度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or an uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: Hey, Phoebe. Hey, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，菲比…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:14.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:14.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:15.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just... I'm out of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:17.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是…我心情不好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, can we get some cappuccino over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能端杯卡布其诺过来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, right. That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}糟了，是我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Chandler. That table place closes at 7. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，卖桌子的七点关门
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:28.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:28.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know Paolo? - I'm familiar with his work, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吧，你们认识保罗吧？ - 他那一招我很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, he made a move on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他勾引我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Whoa. The store will be open tomorrow. - More coffee over here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 店明天还会再开 - 再来杯咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he came in for a massage...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他来店里按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and everything was fine until...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一开始没事后来…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- My God. - Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 天啊 - 你确定？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:13.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And all of a sudden, his hands weren't the problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:13.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的手突然不再是问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:18.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:18.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Boy Scouts could've camped under there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幼童军都能在那儿露营了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:25.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- "Ooh," what? - Ma Thurman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:25.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- “喔”什么啊？ - 瑟曼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh. - The actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 哦 - 那个女演员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uma Thurman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}邬玛·瑟曼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了，瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you gonna you do? - You have to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你有何打算？ - 你得告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to tell her. It's your moral obligation as a friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得告诉她 这是当朋友和女人基本的义务
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:42.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as a woman. I think it's a feminist issue. Guys? Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:42.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为这是女性主义的议题 各位男士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, you have to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，你得告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Feminist issue? That's where I went.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女性主义？ 我也曾遭遇过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:49.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She is gonna hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:49.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她会恨我的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:50.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:50.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you pick one? Just pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便挑一张好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, how about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's patio furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是庭院家具
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:09.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what? Like people are gonna come in and think, "Uh-oh, I'm outside again."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:09.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又怎样  人家进门后会认为 “我又在外面”吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about the birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鸟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:16.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Birds just don't say:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:16.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  鸟不会说：
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Hello, sit here. Eat something."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈罗，坐这儿，吃点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.43,0:12:21.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.43,0:12:21.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你挑一张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:23.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about the ladybugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:23.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，瓢虫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:27.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, so forget about the birds, but big red insects suggest fine dining?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:27.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抛下鸟不管，只因红色昆虫 可以增加食欲？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Do you want the birds? Get the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行，你想买鸟，就买鸟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not like that, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别以为我不会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:36.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kip would've liked the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:36.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基普一定是喜欢鸟的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Hi, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嗨，菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you moving out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要搬走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, these aren't all of my suitcases.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是，这些不全是我的行李箱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one's Paolo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是保罗的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:13:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, Rachel, can we talk for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:13:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，能和你谈谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:03.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, sure. Just for a sec, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:03.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然，但只能聊一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:05.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because Paolo's on his way over. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:05.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…因为保罗马上就来  - 噢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的，唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:14.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, Pheebs... - Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:14.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 哦，菲比… - 唔，好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, ahem. We haven't known each other for that long a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们认识的时间并不是很久
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, um, there are three things that you should know about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该知道我的三件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:26.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One, my friends are the most important thing in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:26.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一，在我生命中朋友是最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:30.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two, I never lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:30.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第二，我从不说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:34.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And three, I make the best oatmeal-raisin cookies in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:34.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第三，我做的燕麦葡萄干饼干天下第一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Thanks, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢，菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:47.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:47.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why have I never tasted these before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么没吃过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I don't make them a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我并不常做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because I don't think it's fair to the other cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为这样 对其他饼干太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahem, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，老天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:04.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you're right. These are the best oatmeal-raisin cookies I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:04.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对，这是我吃过 最好吃的燕麦葡萄干饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:08.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Which proves that I never lie. - I guess you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:08.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这证明我绝不说谎 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:10.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Paolo made a pass at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:10.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保罗向我调情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.79,0:14:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.79,0:14:15.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那，你认为如何
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's the most beautiful table I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我见过最漂亮的桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how does this work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么用？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:22.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gonna balance the plates on these little heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:22.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打算用这些小头平衡盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who cares? We'll eat at the sink. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁在乎 我们在水槽吃 来吧
